  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fADKR\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Tonys_FastFood/BH_TFF_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Tonys_FastFood/BH_TFF_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Tonys_FastFood/BH_TFF_banner1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\">Всегда хотели фастфуд в Minecraft? Теперь это возможно!</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\">С этим модом вы сможете есть куриные наггетсы, бургеры, картошку фри и многое другое.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">Выход обновлений для добавления новых продуктов и напитков</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">для Minecraft</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Tonys_FastFood/BH_TFF_banner2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">По всем вопросам или поддержке переходите на мой сервер Discord</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><br></span></span></p>\n<h1><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QenqTJNpcC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/QenqTJNpcC</a></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">Добавленные продукты</span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">Картошка фри</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1120509740301176875/1121143374632718457/Screenshot_2023-06-21_142042.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">Куриные наггетсы</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1120509740301176875/1121143375324794981/Screenshot_2023-06-21_142106.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"510\" height=\"494\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\">Бургер</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1120509740301176875/1121143375039570060/Screenshot_2023-06-21_142056.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"516\" height=\"455\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">Куриный сэндвич</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1120509740301176875/1123703108560756776/Screenshot_2023-06-28_154136.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"591\" height=\"542\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\">Сыр</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1120509740301176875/1123703122624250017/Screenshot_2023-06-28_154124.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"507\" height=\"472\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\">Сырные палочки</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1120509740301176875/1123703137761513533/Screenshot_2023-06-28_154105.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"602\" height=\"523\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Tonys_FastFood/BH_TFF_banner3.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font